TEST ONLY, NOT A SECRET. A self-signed key for the tests of this repository (local TLS servers that
the tests start on 127.0.0.1); nothing trusts it. Made with: openssl req -x509 -newkey ec -pkeyopt
ec_paramgen_curve:prime256v1 -nodes -days 36500 (SAN localhost, *.localhost, *.example, *.test,
*.github.io, 127.0.0.1, ::1). Text before the PEM block is ignored by Node and OpenSSL.
